                                <p>Most growing companies don’t wake up one day and decide they need custom software. A process gets hard to manage. Teams build workarounds. Information ends up in five places, and decisions start waiting on follow-ups.</p>
                                <p>That’s the moment we’re built for. Hekau is a Pune-based technology partner for $2M–$15M companies in India and abroad. We connect ERP, CRM, workflows and data, so the whole business runs on one version of the truth.</p>
                                <p>We rarely start by asking what software to build. We start with what’s slowing the business down.</p>
